frontend/public/brand/sidira-mark-duo-social.svg:2:  <!-- Paper background — safe for circular crop on LinkedIn / Twitter / X -->
frontend/public/brand/sidira-mark.svg:2:  <title id="title">Sidira mark</title>
frontend/public/brand/sidira-mark.svg:3:  <desc id="desc">Six-blade diaphragm — overlapping triangular blades around a hexagonal aperture. Outer pivots at radius 40, inner vertices at radius 13, both on angles 30°/90°/150°/210°/270°/330° (SVG convention, clockwise from +x). Stroke uses currentColor so the consumer controls the ink. Recommended stroke-width by render size when consumed at scale: 6 at 16px output, 3.5 at 32px, 2.25 at 48px, 1.2 at 96px, 0.7 at 240px+.</desc>
frontend/public/brand/sidira-lockup-duo.svg:2:  <title id="title">Sidira — horizontal lockup (dual-color, standard)</title>
frontend/public/brand/sidira-lockup-duo.svg:3:  <desc id="desc">Standard horizontal lockup: dual-color six-blade diaphragm (Sid-blue left, Avira-rose right) + SIDIRA narrow uppercase in ink. The standard mark on every surface (DESIGN.md §1.3) — in-product nav/dashboard and brand alike. The monochrome lockup (sidira-lockup.svg) is a legacy fallback.</desc>
frontend/public/brand/sidira-mark-duo.svg:2:  <title id="title">Sidira mark — dual-color (standard, §1.3)</title>
frontend/public/brand/sidira-mark-duo.svg:3:  <desc id="desc">Six-blade diaphragm with three Sid-blue (#2C5577) blades on the left and three Avira-rose (#D696C8) blades on the right. Geometry identical to sidira-mark.svg. The standard mark on every surface (DESIGN.md §1.3) — in-product nav/dashboard and brand alike — and the held frame inside the in-product aperture-close animation (§9.2). The monochrome mark (sidira-mark.svg) is a legacy fallback.</desc>
frontend/public/brand/merch/sidira-sticker-wordmark.svg:2:  <title id="title">Sidira sticker · lockup strip (ink on paper)</title>
frontend/public/brand/merch/sidira-sticker-wordmark.svg:3:  <desc id="desc">Rectangular sticker, 80 × 21 mm, radius 6. The primary horizontal lockup (mark + SIDIRA, §3 proportions from sidira-lockup.svg) in ink on paper. Single-color print. Wordmark set in Archivo Narrow SemiBold (MVP stack); convert text to outlines before production. The outer rounded rect is the cut path.</desc>
frontend/public/brand/merch/sidira-sticker-wordmark.svg:6:  <!-- lockup: verbatim composition from sidira-lockup.svg, scaled 0.88 with 12/7 inset -->
frontend/public/brand/merch/sidira-sticker-reading.svg:3:  <desc id="desc">Rectangular sticker, 84 × 30 mm, radius 4. Glass ground (#0A1421) with a signal-lime settle trace (#C8FF3D) carrying its 18%-opacity phosphor underdraw (§4.1), a labeled readings axis with the 0.70 decision threshold marked (§8.4), and honest provenance: the reading is a labeled specimen, not a live value. Text converts to outlines before production. The outer rounded rect is the cut path.</desc>
