frontend/public/brand/merch/sidira-sticker-verdict.svg:3:  <desc id="desc">Rectangular sticker, 84 × 31 mm, radius 4. The §8.1 decision-rule primitive as a physical object: the MVP verdict lexicon stem with its policy beside it. A verdict without its policy never renders, including on a laptop lid. Ink on paper, single-color print. Text converts to outlines before production. The outer rounded rect is the cut path.</desc>
