frontend/public/brand/merch/lookbook.html:231:  <p>Goods follow the same law as the product. Every piece is either <strong>a record</strong> (ink on paper-natural goods) or <strong>a reading</strong> (signal lime on glass-dark goods). Printed traces are records of a labeled specimen run, never decoration: each carries its axis, its threshold, and its provenance. The aperture hexagon is the die-cut shape. Nothing is fully rounded, nothing has a gradient, and lime never touches a light garment.</p>
